      "text": "SpaceX is preparing for its 15th Starship launch from South Texas, with spectators gathering just across the street from the 400-foot rocket ahead of Friday’s planned test flight.\n\nThe test is a key step in SpaceX’s goal of making Starship fully reusable for future missions, including expanding its Starlink network and eventually carrying astronauts to the Moon and Mars, @JasonAllenLive reports.",
